  contraband: []
  boothLines:
  - "\xA1Buenas tardes, oficial! Roberto Salinas, trumpet, Mariachi Los Desvelados.
    Forty-two years. You've heard of us. No? Your mother has."
  - We have a wedding tonight in Las Cruces. The groom's family paid half up front.
    The other half depends on me hitting the high note in 'El Son de la Negra.'
  - My passport? Ah, yes. Expired. Two weeks. But my face is the same, look. Older,
    maybe. Sadder. Same face.
  - Do you want me to play something? It helps with the waiting. No? Okay. I'll hum.
  lineIfApproved: "\xA1Aj\xFAa! I'll play one for you tonight, oficial. You won't
    hear it, but I'll play it."
  lineIfRejected: Two weeks... Okay. The bride will have to walk down the aisle to
    a cell phone.
  lineIfImprisoned: For an EXPIRED PASSPORT? At least let me bring the trumpet. The
    cell needs music.
  onlyIfApproved: {fileID: 0}
  onlyIfNotApproved: {fileID: 0}
  isFamily: 0
